hived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-10-18T06:41:49Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:43:55Z","closed_at":"2024-11-07T01:29:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3.1\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 22.04.4 LTS 64-bit\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen Windows are not embedded, it becomes hard to edit Tree items. The first edit is fine, but every edit afterwards seems to not take the Enter key to submit the edited text. This happens both when using mouse and ui_accept to enter edit mode on the TreeItem.\r\n\r\nOnce the LineEdit Popup is clicked once, the edited text can be submitted. It seems to refocus the window.\r\n\r\nThis also doesn't block typing, and Escape will also cancel the edit just fine.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make tree with editable item.\r\n2. Enter edit mode once.\r\n3. Push enter to submit text. (This one will work.)\r\n4. Enter edit mode again.\r\n5. Push enter to submit text. (This one doesn't work.)\r\n6. Click the LineEdit box.\r\n7. Push enter to submit text. (Now it will work.)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[tree_edit.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17429146/tree_edit.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"OffsetMOSFET","id":91294328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMjk0MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91294328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET","html_url":"https://githu